OL,5,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FLive from Gloucester Cathedral
OL,7,     Fduring the Three Choirs Festival,
OL,8,     Fwith music by Hurd, Gavin Higgins,
OL,9,     FWesley and Bliss.
OL,10,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,11,     F3/5. Donald Macleod surveys some
OL,12,     Fof Alice Mary Smith's
OL,13,     Fcompositional collaborations,
OL,14,     Fincluding with the famed
OL,15,     Fclarinettist Henry Lazarus.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FKatie welcomes Tomorrow's Warriors
OL,18,     Fand violinist Alena Baeva to In
OL,19,     FTune.
